# Built JS/CSS bundles — generated by `npm run build:all` and the
# csproj BuildClientAssets target. Sandbox wwwroot copies are produced
# fresh on every `dotnet build`; packaged assets/ copies are produced
# fresh in the nuget-publish workflow before pack. Tracking them in git
# was pure historical baggage that produced spurious staleness diffs.
